# AWS Static Website Hosting

## Project Overview
This project demonstrates how to create and host a static website using AWS cloud services.

## Objectives
- Understand cloud computing fundamentals.
- Learn static website hosting.
- Explore AWS infrastructure and deployment.
- Practice Git and GitHub version control.

## Technologies Used
- AWS
- Amazon S3
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Git
- GitHub

## Project Workflow
1. Create a static website using HTML and CSS.
2. Create an Amazon S3 bucket.
3. Configure static website hosting.
4. Upload website files to the bucket.
5. Configure permissions securely.
6. Test the website endpoint.

## Skills Learned
- Cloud Computing
- AWS S3
- Website Hosting
- Git & GitHub
- Basic Cloud Deployment

